      'Padabhyanga (foot massage) prevents Padadaha (burning feet), Khalitya (cracking), Gridhrasi (sciatica), improves Nidra (sleep)',
      'Food habits: eat at proper time, proper quantity, warm, unctuous. Avoid eating too fast, too slow, too much, too little',
      'Seasonal Panchakarma: Vamana in Vasanta (spring), Virechana in Sharad (autumn), Basti in Varsha (monsoon)',
