      'Virechana in Sharad (autumn) to eliminate accumulated Pitta from summer - essential for Pitta-predominant individuals',
      'Basti in Varsha (monsoon) to pacify Vata aggravated by rain and cold - essential for Vata-predominant individuals',
      'Preventive Panchakarma: seasonal purification prevents disease accumulation and maintains dosha balance throughout the year',
      'Dietary adaptation: food quality, quantity, and type must change with each season - what is healthy in one season may be harmful in another',
