      'Tears (Ashru) suppression: Kapha vitiation - Tarpaka Kapha disturbed in head, causes eye and head diseases',
      'Sleep (Nidra) suppression: Kapha vitiation - Tarpaka Kapha disturbed, causes drowsiness and head heaviness',
