      'Kantha (throat): controls voice (Vak) and respiration (Shwasa) - Vata-Kapha predominance',
      'Hridaya (heart): controls consciousness (Chetana) and circulation (Rasa Vaha Srotas) - Pitta predominance, Sadhaka Pitta seat',
      'Nabhi (navel): controls Agni (digestive fire) and digestion (Pachana) - Pitta predominance, Jatharagni seat',
      'Basti (bladder): controls urine (Mutra) and reproduction (Shukra) - Kapha-Vata predominance',
      'Guru (rectum): controls elimination (Purisha) and Apana Vata function - Vata predominance',
      'Oja (vital essence): immunity, vitality, and life force - essence of all seven Dhatus',
      'Shukra (semen): reproductive essence, strength, and vitality - Kapha predominance',
      'Rakta (blood): life-sustaining fluid, Pitta carrier, tissue nourishment - Pitta predominance',
      'Mamsa (muscle): protective covering, strength, and movement support - Kapha-Vata predominance',
      'Protection of all ten seats requires: proper diet, lifestyle, seasonal adjustment, and Dosha balance',
      'Prognosis assessment: damage to seat determines disease severity and treatment urgency'
